#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#: src/content/docs/under-the-hood/settings-logic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The two expression fields in Ditana's knowledge base — one keeps an option out of reach, the other moves its value, and most relationships need both."
msgstr "Ils dus champs d’expressiun en la basa da savida da Ditana – l’in renda in’opziun inaccessibla, l’auter mida sia valur, e las pli bleras relaziuns dovran omadus."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: src/content/docs/under-the-hood/settings-logic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "How settings depend on each other"
msgstr "Co ch’ils parameters dependan l’in da l’auter"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/under-the-hood/settings-logic.md
msgid ""
"Two fields in the knowledge base contain logic instead of data, and they "
"respond to two different questions. Confusing them is the mistake this page "
"exists to prevent."
msgstr ""
"Dus champs en la basa da savida cuntegnan logica empè da datas, e quels "
"respundan a duas dumondas differentas. Confunder ils dus champs è il sbagl "
"che questa pagina duai evitar."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/under-the-hood/settings-logic.md
msgid ""
"`available` decides whether a setting is a row the user can reach at all. "
"`default-value` decides what it is set to – not once, but every time "
"something its expression names changes."
msgstr ""
"`available` decida, sch’in parameter è insumma ina lingia accessibla. "
"`default-value` decida, sin tge valur ch’el vegn fixà – betg ina giada, "
"mabain mintga giada ch’insatge che sia expressiun numna sa mida."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/content/docs/under-the-hood/settings-logic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "An option that cannot be chosen"
msgstr "In’opziun che na po betg vegnir tschernida"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/under-the-hood/settings-logic.md
msgid ""
"A setting whose `available` expression is false is not rendered. The dialog "
"is built from the settings that are available, so the row is simply not "
"there, and the instruction above the list gains a note saying how many "
"settings are missing and where to read about them."
msgstr ""
"In parameter cun in’expressiun `available` faussa na vegn betg mussà. Il "
"dialog vegn construì cun ils parameters disponibels, perquai manca la lingia "
"simplamain, e l’instrucziun sur la glista survegn in avis che di quants "
"parameters mancan e nua ch’ins po leger davart els."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/under-the-hood/settings-logic.md
msgid ""
"It does not vanish without a trace. The help text of the dialog lists every "
"unavailable setting of that dialog under a heading of its own, with its full "
"description and one line more, in which the expression is that setting’s own "
"`available` condition with the backticks taken off:"
msgstr ""
"El na svanescha betg senza fastizs. Il text d’agid dal dialog enumerescha "
"mintga parameter betg disponibel da quel dialog sut in agen titel, cun sia "
"descripziun cumpletta ed ina lingia supplementara, en la quala l’expressiun "
"è la cundiziun `available` dal parameter sez, senza ils accents grevs:"

#. type: Fenced code block (text)
#: src/content/docs/under-the-hood/settings-logic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "=== Condition of availability: === <the expression>\n"
msgstr "=== Condition of availability: === <the expression>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/under-the-hood/settings-logic.md
msgid ""
"Losing availability does not in itself mean losing the value. The engine "
"switches an unavailable setting off in exactly one place: when the user "
"confirms a dialog, across the rows of that dialog, for a setting whose "
"availability the user has just removed via their own change in that dialog. "
"A setting that becomes unavailable due to something the user did in a "
"different dialog keeps whatever value it previously held, and it is no "
"longer present as a row anywhere, so nothing there will interact with it "
"again."
msgstr ""
"Perder la disponibilitad na munta anc betg perder la valur. Il motor "
"deactivescha in parameter betg disponibel en precis in lieu: cura ch’in "
"dialog vegn confermà, per las lingias da quel dialog, per in parameter al "
"qual l’utilisadra u l’utilisader ha gist prendì la disponibilitad cun sia "
"atgna midada en quel dialog. In parameter che daventa betg disponibel pervi "
"d’insatge che l’utilisadra u l’utilisader ha fatg en in auter dialog, "
"mantegna la valur ch’el aveva avant, e n’è nagliur pli preschent sco lingia; "
"perquai na vegn nagut là pli ad interagir cun el."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/under-the-hood/settings-logic.md
msgid ""
"That is what the second field is for, and it is why the two are so often "
"used together."
msgstr ""
"Per quai serva il segund champ, e perquai vegnan ils dus champs uschè savens "
"utilisads ensemen."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/content/docs/under-the-hood/settings-logic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "An option that follows another"
msgstr "In’opziun che suonda in’autra"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/under-the-hood/settings-logic.md
msgid ""
"A `default-value` might be an expression, and such an expression is not a "
"fallback. Whenever a setting it names changes, the engine re-evaluates it "
"and applies the result – over a value the user chose by hand, if that is "
"what the expression now says. The engine keeps no record of who set a value, "
"so there is nothing for it to defer to. Only a literal `default-value` "
"behaves as a starting value and is then left alone."
msgstr ""
"In `default-value` po esser in’expressiun, ed ina tala expressiun n’è betg "
"ina soluziun da reserva. Mintga giada ch’in parameter ch’ella numna sa mida, "
"evaluescha il motor l’expressiun danovamain ed applitgescha il resultat – er "
"sch’el remplazza ina valur che l’utilisadra u l’utilisader ha tschernì a "
"maun, sche l’expressiun di ussa quai. Il motor na tegna nagin register da "
"tgi ch’ha fixà ina valur; perquai n’ha el nagut ch’el pudess respectar. Mo "
"in `default-value` litteral sa cumporta sco valur da partenza e na vegn lura "
"betg pli tutgà."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/under-the-hood/settings-logic.md
msgid ""
"The result travels: applying it may change a setting a third expression "
"names, which is evaluated in turn. Nothing in the engine knows about any "
"particular setting; the whole chain is in the data."
msgstr ""
"Il resultat va vinavant: sia applicaziun po midar in parameter ch’ina terza "
"expressiun numna, e quella vegn lura evaluada da sia vart. Nagut en il motor "
"n’enconuscha in parameter specific; l’entira chadaina sa chatta en las datas."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/content/docs/under-the-hood/settings-logic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The file system dialog, in full"
msgstr "Il dialog dal sistem da datotecas en tut ses detagls"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/under-the-hood/settings-logic.md
msgid ""
"ZFS needs DKMS, and DKMS on a kernel that has progressed beyond what OpenZFS "
"supports cannot build. Ditana therefore pairs ZFS with the long-term support "
"kernel, and it takes both fields to do it:"
msgstr ""
"ZFS dovra DKMS, e DKMS na po betg construir sin in kernel pli nov che las "
"versiuns che OpenZFS sustegna. Perquai cumbina Ditana ZFS cun il kernel cun "
"sustegn a lunga durada, e per quai èn necessaris omadus champs:"

#. type: Fenced code block (kdl)
#: src/content/docs/under-the-hood/settings-logic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- name=\"zfs-filesystem\" \\\n"
"  available=\"`install-standard-lts-kernel`\" \\\n"
"  default-value=\"`install-standard-lts-kernel AND NOT profile-quick`\" {\n"
"    // ...\n"
"  }\n"
msgstr ""
"- name=\"zfs-filesystem\" \\\n"
"  available=\"`install-standard-lts-kernel`\" \\\n"
"  default-value=\"`install-standard-lts-kernel AND NOT profile-quick`\" {\n"
"    // ...\n"
"  }\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/under-the-hood/settings-logic.md
msgid ""
"The `available` line is the gate. Choosing a different kernel does not move "
"ZFS onto the LTS kernel and does not leave ZFS running on a kernel it cannot "
"build against: the ZFS row is gone from the file system dialog, and the "
"pairing holds because the unpaired state is not one the user can select."
msgstr ""
"La lingia `available` è la barriera. Tscherner in auter kernel na sposta "
"betg ZFS sin il kernel LTS e na lascha er betg funcziunar ZFS sin in kernel, "
"per il qual el na po betg vegnir construì: la lingia ZFS n’è betg pli en il "
"dialog dal sistem da datotecas, e la cumbinaziun resta intacta, perquai "
"ch’il stadi senza cumbinaziun na po betg vegnir tschernì."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/under-the-hood/settings-logic.md
msgid ""
"For that setting the help says, in the file system dialog of an installation "
"that is not on the long-term support kernel:"
msgstr ""
"Per quest parameter di l’agid, en il dialog dal sistem da datotecas "
"d’in’installaziun che n’utilisescha betg il kernel cun sustegn a lunga "
"durada:"

#. type: Fenced code block (text)
#: src/content/docs/under-the-hood/settings-logic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "=== Condition of availability: === install-standard-lts-kernel\n"
msgstr "=== Condition of availability: === install-standard-lts-kernel\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/under-the-hood/settings-logic.md
msgid ""
"The `default-value` line is what makes the gate bite from another dialog. "
"The kernel is chosen in the Kernel Selection dialog, where ZFS is not a row, "
"so the rule that switches an unavailable setting off never reaches it. "
"Naming the same condition in `default-value` is what turns ZFS off – and it "
"is why forty-five settings in the knowledge base carry an expression in both "
"fields. The two are not alternatives."
msgstr ""
"La lingia `default-value` è quella che fa agir la barriera er a partir d’in "
"auter dialog. Il kernel vegn tschernì en il dialog Kernel Selection, nua che "
"ZFS n’è nagina lingia; perquai na cuntanscha la regla che deactivescha in "
"parameter betg disponibel mai ZFS. Numnar la medema cundiziun en `default-"
"value` è quai che deactivescha ZFS – e quai è il motiv pertge che "
"quarantatschintg parameters en la basa da savida han in’expressiun en omadus "
"champs. Ils dus champs n’èn betg alternativas."

#. type: Fenced code block (kdl)
#: src/content/docs/under-the-hood/settings-logic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- name=\"btrfs-filesystem\" \\\n"
"  default-value=\"`profile-quick OR NOT install-standard-lts-kernel`\" {\n"
"    arch-packages \"btrfs-progs\" \"compsize\"\n"
"  }\n"
msgstr ""
"- name=\"btrfs-filesystem\" \\\n"
"  default-value=\"`profile-quick OR NOT install-standard-lts-kernel`\" {\n"
"    arch-packages \"btrfs-progs\" \"compsize\"\n"
"  }\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/under-the-hood/settings-logic.md
msgid ""
"Btrfs is the default of the file system dialog whenever the Quick "
"Installation profile is chosen or the LTS kernel is not selected. The two "
"expressions are complementary halves of the same condition, so exactly one "
"file system is chosen at any moment. A user who switches the kernel away "
"from LTS therefore finds, on returning to the file system dialog, that the "
"ZFS row is gone, that Btrfs is chosen, and that the note above the list "
"points at the help, where the condition that removed ZFS is printed out."
msgstr ""
"Btrfs è la valur da standard dal dialog dal sistem da datotecas, mintga "
"giada ch’il profil Quick Installation è tschernì u ch’il kernel LTS n’è betg "
"tschernì. Las duas expressiuns èn mesadads cumplementaras da la medema "
"cundiziun, uschia ch’en mintga mument è tschernì exactamain in sistem da "
"datotecas. Tgi che remplazza il kernel LTS cun in auter kernel chatta "
"perquai, turnond al dialog dal sistem da datotecas, che la lingia ZFS è "
"svanida, che Btrfs è tschernì e che l’avis sur la glista renviescha a "
"l’agid, nua ch’è scritta la cundiziun che ha allontanà ZFS."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/under-the-hood/settings-logic.md
msgid ""
"The LTS kernel starts as the default, so in a standard setup nothing here "
"appears: ZFS is offered, and choosing it changes no kernel since the kernel "
"is already right."
msgstr ""
"Il kernel LTS è la valur da standard; perquai na cumpara nagut da quai en "
"ina configuraziun da standard: ZFS vegn purschì, e sch’ins al tscherna, na "
"vegn nagin kernel midà, perquai ch’il kernel è gia il dretg."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/content/docs/under-the-hood/settings-logic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "What this means for a contribution"
msgstr "Tge che quai munta per ina contribuziun"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/under-the-hood/settings-logic.md
msgid ""
"The two fields answer two questions, and a relationship typically needs both "
"answered. Does the option make sense at all under this condition – that is "
"`available`, and it removes the row. Should the option follow this condition "
"– that is `default-value`, and it moves the value, from any dialog. A gate "
"whose condition is decided in the same dialog can do with `available` alone; "
"a gate whose condition lives elsewhere cannot, and that is the common case."
msgstr ""
"Ils dus champs respundan a duas dumondas, ed ina relaziun dovra per regla "
"ina resposta ad omaduas. Ha l’opziun insumma in senn sut questa cundiziun – "
"quai è `available`, e quel allontanescha la lingia. Duai l’opziun suandar "
"questa cundiziun – quai è `default-value`, e quel mida la valur, a partir da "
"mintga dialog. Per ina barriera cun ina cundiziun che vegn decidida en il "
"medem dialog basta `available` sulet; per ina barriera cun ina cundiziun che "
"sa chatta en in auter lieu na basta quai betg, e quai è il cas usità."
